    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    N, M = map(int, input().split())\n    S = input()\n\n    plain_shirts = M\n    logo_shirts_owned = 0\n    max_logo_shirts_needed = 0\n\n    for day_type in S:\n        if day_type == '0':\n            plain_shirts = M\n            logo_shirts_owned = max_logo_shirts_needed\n        elif day_type == '1':\n            if plain_shirts > 0:\n                plain_shirts -= 1\n            elif logo_shirts_owned > 0:\n                logo_shirts_owned -= 1\n            else:\n                max_logo_shirts_needed += 1\n        elif day_type == '2':\n            if logo_shirts_owned > 0:\n                logo_shirts_owned -= 1\n            else:\n                max_logo_shirts_needed += 1\n    \n    print(max_logo_shirts_needed)\n\nsolve()\n```",
