      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef countKeyChanges(s: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of times the user had to change the key.\n    A key change is defined as using a key different from the last used key,\n    ignoring case differences.\n\n    Args:\n        s: The input string typed by the user.\n\n    Returns:\n        The number of key changes.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not s:\n        return 0\n\n    changes = 0\n    for i in range(1, len(s)):\n        if s[i].lower() != s[i - 1].lower():\n            changes += 1\n    return changes\n```",
