      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    N = int(sys.stdin.readline())\n    cuboids = []\n    for _ in range(N):\n        x1, y1, z1, x2, y2, z2 = map(int, sys.stdin.readline().split())\n        cuboids.append(((x1, y1, z1), (x2, y2, z2)))\n\n    results = [0] * N\n\n    for i in range(N):\n        (x1_i, y1_i, z1_i), (x2_i, y2_i, z2_i) = cuboids[i]\n\n        for j in range(N):\n            if i == j:\n                continue\n\n            (x1_j, y1_j, z1_j), (x2_j, y2_j, z2_j) = cuboids[j]\n\n            # Check for shared face along X-axis\n            if (x2_i == x1_j or x1_i == x2_j) and \\\n               max(y1_i, y1_j) < min(y2_i, y2_j) and \\\n               max(z1_i, z1_j) < min(z2_i, z2_j):\n                results[i] += 1\n                continue # A face can only be shared once\n\n            # Check for shared face along Y-axis\n            if (y2_i == y1_j or y1_i == y2_j) and \\\n               max(x1_i, x1_j) < min(x2_i, x2_j) and \\\n               max(z1_i, z1_j) < min(z2_i, z2_j):\n                results[i] += 1\n                continue\n\n            # Check for shared face along Z-axis\n            if (z2_i == z1_j or z1_i == z2_j) and \\\n               max(x1_i, x1_j) < min(x2_i, x2_j) and \\\n               max(y1_i, y1_j) < min(y2_i, y2_j):\n                results[i] += 1\n                continue\n\n    for res in results:\n        print(res)\n\ndef main():\n    solve()\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```",
