      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nfrom collections import Counter\n\ndef solve():\n    t = int(sys.stdin.readline())\n    results = []\n    for _ in range(t):\n        n, k = map(int, sys.stdin.readline().split())\n        s = sys.stdin.readline().strip()\n\n        char_counts = Counter(s)\n        \n        odd_freq_count = 0\n        for count in char_counts.values():\n            if count % 2 != 0:\n                odd_freq_count += 1\n        \n        remaining_len = n - k\n\n        if remaining_len < 0:\n            results.append(\"NO\")\n            continue\n\n        if odd_freq_count - k <= 1 and remaining_len >= odd_freq_count:\n            results.append(\"YES\")\n        else:\n            results.append(\"NO\")\n            \n    sys.stdout.write(\"\\n\".join(results) + \"\\n\")\n\nsolve()\n```",
