307262781240755\n3 7 12070267388230\n3 8 700247263184082\n4 5 560567890325333\n4 6 704726113717147\n4 7 588263818615687\n4 8 549007536393172\n5 6 779230871080408\n5 7 825982583786498\n5 8 713928998174272\n6 7 751331074538826\n6 8 449873635430228\n7 8 11298381761479\n\nSample Output 3\n\n11360716373\n\nNote that the input and the answer may not fit into a 32\\operatorname{{bit}} integer.",
