      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef count_unreceived_requests(n: int, logs: list[list[int]], x: int, queries: list[int]) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of servers that did not receive any requests during specified time intervals.\n\n    Args:\n        n: The total number of servers.\n        logs: A 2D 0-indexed integer array where logs[i] = [server_id, time] denotes that the server\n              with id server_id received a request at time time.\n        x: An integer representing the duration before the query time.\n        queries: A 0-indexed integer array where each element represents an end time for a query interval.\n\n    Returns:\n        A 0-indexed integer array arr of length queries.length where arr[i] represents the number of\n        servers that did not receive any requests during the time interval [queries[i] - x, queries[i]].\n    \"\"\"\n    server_requests = [[] for _ in range(n + 1)]\n    for server_id, time in logs:\n        server_requests[server_id].append(time)\n\n    # Sort the requests for each server to efficiently check for requests within an interval\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        server_requests[i].sort()\n\n    results = []\n    for query_end_time in queries:\n        interval_start = query_end_time - x\n        interval_end = query_end_time\n\n        unreceived_count = 0\n        for server_id in range(1, n + 1):\n            has_request_in_interval = False\n            # Use binary search to find if there's any request within the interval\n            # bisect_left finds the insertion point for interval_start\n            # bisect_right finds the insertion point for interval_end\n            \n            # Find the first request time >= interval_start\n            import bisect\n            idx = bisect.bisect_left(server_requests[server_id], interval_start)\n            \n            # If such a request exists and it's also <= interval_end\n            if idx < len(server_requests[server_id]) and server_requests[server_id][idx] <= interval_end:\n                has_request_in_interval = True\n\n            if not has_request_in_interval:\n                unreceived_count += 1\n        results.append(unreceived_count)\n\n    return results\n\n```",
