      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef beautiful_integers(low: int, high: int, k: int) -> int:\n    def is_beautiful(n: int, k: int) -> bool:\n        if n % k != 0:\n            return False\n\n        s_n = str(n)\n        even_count = 0\n        odd_count = 0\n        for digit_char in s_n:\n            digit = int(digit_char)\n            if digit % 2 == 0:\n                even_count += 1\n            else:\n                odd_count += 1\n        return even_count == odd_count\n\n    count = 0\n    for num in range(low, high + 1):\n        if is_beautiful(num, k):\n            count += 1\n    return count\n```",
