m_r_idx + 1) // 2] - (A[sum_r_idx] - r)\n        else: # A[sum_r_idx] is a \"wake up\" time, meaning A[sum_r_idx-1] was go-to-bed.\n            sleep_to_r = sleep_prefix_sum[sum_r_idx // 2]\n\n        # Total sleep up to l\n        sum_l_idx = bisect.bisect_left(A, l)\n        sleep_to_l = 0\n        if sum_l_idx % 2 == 1: # A[sum_l_idx] is a \"go to bed\" time\n            sleep_to_l = sleep_prefix_sum[(sum_l_idx + 1) // 2] - (A[sum_l_idx] - l)\n        else: # A[sum_l_idx] is a \"wake up\" time\n            sleep_to_l = sleep_prefix_sum[sum_l_idx // 2]\n\n        ans = sleep_to_r - sleep_to_l\n        print(ans)\n\n\nsolve()\n```",
