      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    H, W = map(int, input().split())\n    grid = [list(input()) for _ in range(H)]\n\n    removed_flags = [[False for _ in range(W)] for _ in range(H)]\n\n    while True:\n        marked_this_turn = False\n        newly_removed_flags = [row[:] for row in removed_flags]\n\n        # Step 1: Mark rows\n        for r in range(H):\n            if all(newly_removed_flags[r][c] for c in range(W)):\n                continue\n\n            first_color = None\n            same_color_count = 0\n            remaining_cookies_in_row = []\n\n            for c in range(W):\n                if not newly_removed_flags[r][c]:\n                    remaining_cookies_in_row.append((r, c, grid[r][c]))\n                    if first_color is None:\n                        first_color = grid[r][c]\n                    if grid[r][c] == first_color:\n                        same_color_count += 1\n            \n            if len(remaining_cookies_in_row) >= 2 and same_color_count == len(remaining_cookies_in_row):\n                for r_idx, c_idx, _ in remaining_cookies_in_row:\n                    if not newly_removed_flags[r_idx][c_idx]:\n                        newly_removed_flags[r_idx][c_idx] = True\n                        marked_this_turn = True\n\n        # Step 2: Mark columns\n        for c in range(W):\n            if all(newly_removed_flags[r][c] for r in range(H)):\n                continue\n            \n            first_color = None\n            same_color_count = 0\n            remaining_cookies_in_col = []\n\n            for r in range(H):\n                if not newly_removed_flags[r][c]:\n                    remaining_cookies_in_col.append((r, c, grid[r][c]))\n                    if first_color is None:\n                        first_color = grid[r][c]\n                    if grid[r][c] == first_color:\n                        same_color_count += 1\n            \n            if len(remaining_cookies_in_col) >= 2 and same_color_count == len(remaining_cookies_in_col):\n                for r_idx, c_idx, _ in remaining_cookies_in_col:\n                    if not newly_removed_flags[r_idx][c_idx]:\n                        newly_removed_flags[r_idx][c_idx] = True\n                        marked_this_turn = True\n        \n        if marked_this_turn:\n            removed_flags = newly_removed_flags\n        else:\n            break\n\n    remaining_count = 0\n    for r in range(H):\n        for c in range(W):\n            if not removed_flags[r][c]:\n                remaining_count += 1\n    \n    print(remaining_count)\n\nsolve()\n```",
