    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    x, y, z = map(int, sys.stdin.readline().split())\n    s = sys.stdin.readline().strip()\n    n = len(s)\n\n    # dp[i][0] = minimum cost to form the first i characters of S with Caps Lock OFF\n    # dp[i][1] = minimum cost to form the first i characters of S with Caps Lock ON\n    dp = [[float('inf')] * 2 for _ in range(n + 1)]\n\n    # Base case: empty string\n    dp[0][0] = 0\n\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        char = s[i - 1]\n\n        # Calculate cost for Caps Lock OFF at step i\n        if char == 'a':\n            # Option 1: Append 'a' with Caps Lock OFF (press 'a' key)\n            dp[i][0] = min(dp[i][0], dp[i - 1][0] + x)\n            # Option 2: Append 'a' with Caps Lock ON, then toggle Caps Lock\n            dp[i][0] = min(dp[i][0], dp[i - 1][1] + z + x)\n        else: # char == 'A'\n            # Option 1: Append 'A' with Caps Lock OFF (press 'a' + Shift)\n            dp[i][0] = min(dp[i][0], dp[i - 1][0] + y)\n            # Option 2: Append 'A' with Caps Lock ON, then toggle Caps Lock\n            dp[i][0] = min(dp[i][0], dp[i - 1][1] + z + y)\n\n        # Calculate cost for Caps Lock ON at step i\n        if char == 'a':\n            # Option 1: Append 'a' with Caps Lock ON (press 'a' + Shift)\n            dp[i][1] = min(dp[i][1], dp[i - 1][1] + y)\n            # Option 2: Append 'a' with Caps Lock OFF, then toggle Caps Lock\n            dp[i][1] = min(dp[i][1], dp[i - 1][0] + z + y)\n        else: # char == 'A'\n            # Option 1: Append 'A' with Caps Lock ON (press 'a' key)\n            dp[i][1] = min(dp[i][1], dp[i - 1][1] + x)\n            # Option 2: Append 'A' with Caps Lock OFF, then toggle Caps Lock\n            dp[i][1] = min(dp[i][1], dp[i - 1][0] + z + x)\n\n    print(min(dp[n][0], dp[n][1]))\n\ndef main():\n    solve()\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```",
