    "prediction": "google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef harshad_number(x: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if an integer is a Harshad number and returns the sum of its digits if it is,\n    otherwise returns -1.\n\n    Args:\n        x: The integer to check.\n\n    Returns:\n        The sum of digits of x if x is a Harshad number, otherwise -1.\n    \"\"\"\n    sum_digits = sum(int(digit) for digit in str(x))\n    if x % sum_digits == 0:\n        return sum_digits\n    else:\n        return -1\n```",
