      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom collections import deque\n\ndef continuousSubarrays(nums: list[int]) -> int:\n    n = len(nums)\n    count = 0\n    left = 0\n    min_dq = deque()  # Stores indices of elements in increasing order\n    max_dq = deque()  # Stores indices of elements in decreasing order\n\n    for right in range(n):\n        # Maintain min_dq in increasing order\n        while min_dq and nums[min_dq[-1]] >= nums[right]:\n            min_dq.pop()\n        min_dq.append(right)\n\n        # Maintain max_dq in decreasing order\n        while max_dq and nums[max_dq[-1]] <= nums[right]:\n            max_dq.pop()\n        max_dq.append(right)\n\n        # Shrink the window from the left if the condition is violated\n        while nums[max_dq[0]] - nums[min_dq[0]] > 2:\n            left += 1\n            # Remove elements from deques that are no longer in the window\n            if min_dq[0] < left:\n                min_dq.popleft()\n            if max_dq[0] < left:\n                max_dq.popleft()\n\n        # All subarrays ending at 'right' and starting from 'left' are continuous\n        count += (right - left + 1)\n\n    return count\n```",
