      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport collections\nimport math\n\ndef solve():\n    N, D = map(int, input().split())\n    coords = []\n    for _ in range(N):\n        coords.append(list(map(int, input().split())))\n\n    infected = [False] * N\n    infected[0] = True \n    q = collections.deque()\n    q.append(0) \n\n    while q:\n        u = q.popleft()\n        \n        for v in range(N):\n            if not infected[v]:\n                dist = math.sqrt((coords[u][0] - coords[v][0])**2 + (coords[u][1] - coords[v][1])**2)\n                if dist <= D:\n                    infected[v] = True\n                    q.append(v)\n    \n    for i in range(N):\n        if infected[i]:\n            print(\"Yes\")\n        else:\n            print(\"No\")\n\nsolve()\n```",
