      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef calculate_remaining_balance(purchaseAmount: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the remaining bank account balance after a rounded purchase.\n\n    Args:\n        purchaseAmount: The initial purchase amount in dollars.\n\n    Returns:\n        The account balance after the purchase.\n    \"\"\"\n    initial_balance = 100\n    remainder = purchaseAmount % 10\n\n    if remainder < 5:\n        rounded_amount = purchaseAmount - remainder\n    else:\n        rounded_amount = purchaseAmount + (10 - remainder) if remainder != 0 else purchaseAmount\n\n    return initial_balance - rounded_amount\n```",
