      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef longestSemiRepetitiveSubstring(s: str) -> int:\n    n = len(s)\n    max_len = 0\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            substring = s[i : j + 1]\n            consecutive_pairs = 0\n            for k in range(len(substring) - 1):\n                if substring[k] == substring[k + 1]:\n                    consecutive_pairs += 1\n            if consecutive_pairs <= 1:\n                max_len = max(max_len, len(substring))\n\n    return max_len\n```",
