    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef sum_of_squares_of_distinct_counts(nums: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the squares of distinct counts of all subarrays of nums.\n\n    Args:\n        nums: A 0-indexed integer array.\n\n    Returns:\n        The sum of the squares of distinct counts of all subarrays of nums.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(nums)\n    total_sum_of_squares = 0\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            # nums[i..j] is the current subarray\n            subarray = nums[i : j + 1]\n            distinct_count = len(set(subarray))\n            total_sum_of_squares += distinct_count ** 2\n\n    return total_sum_of_squares\n```",
