      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef incremovableSubarrayCount(nums):\n    n = len(nums)\n    count = 0\n\n    def is_strictly_increasing(arr):\n        if not arr or len(arr) == 1:\n            return True\n        for i in range(len(arr) - 1):\n            if arr[i] >= arr[i+1]:\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            # Form the new array by removing nums[i:j+1]\n            temp_arr = nums[:i] + nums[j+1:]\n            if is_strictly_increasing(temp_arr):\n                count += 1\n    return count\n```",
