      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef permutation_difference(s: str, t: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the permutation difference between two strings s and t.\n\n    Args:\n        s: The first string, where each character occurs at most once.\n        t: The second string, which is a permutation of s.\n\n    Returns:\n        The permutation difference between s and t.\n    \"\"\"\n    s_index_map = {char: i for i, char in enumerate(s)}\n    t_index_map = {char: i for i, char in enumerate(t)}\n\n    permutation_diff = 0\n    for char in s:\n        permutation_diff += abs(s_index_map[char] - t_index_map[char])\n\n    return permutation_diff\n```",
