      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef maxStrength(nums):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the maximum strength of a group of students.\n\n    Args:\n        nums: A list of integers representing the scores of students.\n\n    Returns:\n        The maximum strength of a group the teacher can create.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(nums)\n    max_product = float('-inf')\n\n    # Iterate through all possible non-empty subsets (groups) of students\n    for i in range(1, 1 << n):  # 1 << n is 2^n, representing all possible subsets\n        current_product = 1\n        has_elements = False\n        for j in range(n):\n            # Check if the j-th student is in the current subset\n            if (i >> j) & 1:\n                current_product *= nums[j]\n                has_elements = True\n        \n        # Only update max_product if the group is non-empty\n        if has_elements:\n            max_product = max(max_product, current_product)\n            \n    return max_product\n```",
