    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef get_occupied_positions(nums, moveFrom, moveTo):\n    \"\"\"\n    Given initial positions of marbles, and a series of moves, return the sorted list of occupied positions.\n\n    Args:\n        nums (list[int]): A 0-indexed integer array representing the initial positions of some marbles.\n        moveFrom (list[int]): A 0-indexed integer array of positions from where marbles are moved.\n        moveTo (list[int]): A 0-indexed integer array of positions to where marbles are moved.\n\n    Returns:\n        list[int]: The sorted list of occupied positions after all moves.\n    \"\"\"\n    occupied_positions = set(nums)\n\n    for i in range(len(moveFrom)):\n        source = moveFrom[i]\n        destination = moveTo[i]\n\n        if source in occupied_positions:\n            occupied_positions.remove(source)\n            occupied_positions.add(destination)\n\n    return sorted(list(occupied_positions))\n```",
