      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    n, m = map(int, input().split())\n    a = list(map(int, input().split()))\n    s = [input() for _ in range(n)]\n\n    player_scores = []\n    for i in range(n):\n        current_score = i + 1  # Player bonus\n        for j in range(m):\n            if s[i][j] == 'o':\n                current_score += a[j]\n        player_scores.append(current_score)\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        max_other_score = 0\n        for j in range(n):\n            if i != j:\n                max_other_score = max(max_other_score, player_scores[j])\n\n        if player_scores[i] > max_other_score:\n            print(0)\n            continue\n\n        problems_to_solve = 0\n        current_player_score = player_scores[i]\n        unsolved_indices = [k for k in range(m) if s[i][k] == 'x']\n        unsolved_indices.sort(key=lambda x: a[x], reverse=True)\n\n        needs = max_other_score - current_player_score + 1\n\n        for idx in unsolved_indices:\n            if needs <= 0:\n                break\n            current_player_score += a[idx]\n            problems_to solve += 1\n            needs = max_other_score - current_player_score + 1\n        print(problems_to_solve)\n\nsolve()\n```",
