`digit_char != s[v]`, `v = s_pi[v-1]`.\n                                                                                #   If `digit_char == s[v]`, `v++`.\n                                                                                #   Return `v`.\n                                                                                \n                                                                                # Special case: if `s_len == 0`, `current_sml_len == 0`.\n                                                                                # If `s_len == 1`, `s_pi` is [0]. `s_pi[0-1]` is out of bounds.\n                                                                                # If `s_len > 0`:\n                                                                                temp_v = s_pi[s_len - 1]\n                                                                                while temp_v > 0 and digit_char != s[temp_v]:\n                                                                                    temp_v = s_pi[temp_v - 1]\n                                                                                if digit_char == s[temp_v]:\n                                                                                    temp_v += 1\n                                                                                return temp_v\n                                                                            else: # `current_sml_len < s_len`\n                                                                                # Standard KMP transition\n                                                                                v = current_sml_len\n                                                                                while v > 0 and digit_char != s[v]:\n                                                                                    v = s_pi[v - 1]\n                                                                                if digit_char == s[v