    "prediction": "google/gemini-2.5-flash",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef min_cost_of_subarrays(nums: list[int]) -> int:\n    n = len(nums)\n    min_total_cost = float('inf')\n\n    # Iterate through all possible split points for the first two subarrays\n    # i is the index where the first subarray ends (exclusive)\n    # j is the index where the second subarray ends (exclusive)\n    for i in range(1, n - 1):  # i must be at least 1, and can't be the last element\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):  # j must be after i, and can't be the last element\n            # First subarray: nums[0...i-1]\n            cost1 = nums[0]\n\n            # Second subarray: nums[i...j-1]\n            cost2 = nums[i]\n\n            # Third subarray: nums[j...n-1]\n            cost3 = nums[j]\n\n            current_total_cost = cost1 + cost2 + cost3\n            min_total_cost = min(min_total_cost, current_total_cost)\n\n    return min_total_cost\n```",
