      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef beautifulIndices(s: str, a: str, b: str, k: int) -> list[int]:\n    n = len(s)\n    a_indices = []\n    b_indices = []\n\n    for i in range(n - len(a) + 1):\n        if s[i : i + len(a)] == a:\n            a_indices.append(i)\n\n    for i in range(n - len(b) + 1):\n        if s[i : i + len(b)] == b:\n            b_indices.append(i)\n\n    beautiful = []\n    for i in a_indices:\n        for j in b_indices:\n            if abs(i - j) <= k:\n                beautiful.append(i)\n                break\n\n    return sorted(beautiful)\n```",
