      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef min_coins_to_add(coins: list[int], target: int) -> int:\n    coins.sort()\n    reachable_sum = 0\n    added_coins = 0\n    coin_index = 0\n\n    while reachable_sum < target:\n        if coin_index < len(coins) and coins[coin_index] <= reachable_sum + 1:\n            reachable_sum += coins[coin_index]\n            coin_index += 1\n        else:\n            # We need to add a coin\n            # The smallest number we cannot make is reachable_sum + 1\n            # To extend the reachable sum as much as possible, we should add\n            # a coin with value reachable_sum + 1.\n            added_coins += 1\n            reachable_sum += (reachable_sum + 1)\n    \n    return added_coins\n```",
