      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    def is_prime(n):\n        if n < 2:\n            return False\n        for i in range(2, int(n**0.5) + 1):\n            if n % i == 0:\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    nums = eval(input())\n\n    prime_indices = []\n    for i, num in enumerate(nums):\n        if is_prime(num):\n            prime_indices.append(i)\n\n    if len(prime_indices) < 2:\n        return 0\n    else:\n        return max(prime_indices) - min(prime_indices)\n```",
