n    # Let's adjust the condition. The winner is the first one to reach (N+1)//2 wins.\n    # For N=5, (5+1)//2 = 3. First to reach 3 wins.\n    # For N=6, (6+1)//2 = 3. First to reach 3 wins.\n\n    t_wins = 0\n    a_wins = 0\n    winning_threshold = (N + 1) // 2\n\n    for char in S:\n        if char == 'T':\n            t_wins += 1\n            if t_wins == winning_threshold:\n                print('T')\n                return\n        else: # char == 'A'\n            a_wins += 1\n            if a_wins == winning_threshold:\n                print('A')\n                return\n\nfind_overall_winner()\n```",
