      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport collections\nimport math\n\ndef min_groups_for_assignment(nums: list[int]) -> int:\n    counts = collections.Counter(nums)\n    freqs = list(counts.values())\n    \n    unique_freqs = sorted(list(set(freqs)))\n\n    def check(k):\n        for freq in freqs:\n            low = math.ceil(freq / (k + 1))\n            high = math.floor(freq / k)\n            if low > high:\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    for k in unique_freqs:\n        if check(k):\n            return k\n\n    return unique_freqs[-1] + 1\n```",
