      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minOperations(num: str) -> int:\n    n = len(num)\n    ans = n\n\n    # Check for \"00\"\n    for i in range(n - 1, -1, -1):\n        if num[i] == '0':\n            for j in range(i - 1, -1, -1):\n                if num[j] == '0':\n                    ans = min(ans, n - 2)\n                    break\n            break\n\n    # Check for \"25\"\n    for i in range(n - 1, -1, -1):\n        if num[i] == '5':\n            for j in range(i - 1, -1, -1):\n                if num[j] == '2':\n                    ans = min(ans, n - 2)\n                    break\n            break\n\n    # Check for \"50\"\n    for i in range(n - 1, -1, -1):\n        if num[i] == '0':\n            for j in range(i - 1, -1, -1):\n                if num[j] == '5':\n                    ans = min(ans, n - 2)\n                    break\n            break\n\n    # Check for \"75\"\n    for i in range(n - 1, -1, -1):\n        if num[i] == '5':\n            for j in range(i - 1, -1, -1):\n                if num[j] == '7':\n                    ans = min(ans, n - 2)\n                    break\n            break\n\n    # Check for single \"0\"\n    if '0' in num:\n        ans = min(ans, n - 1)\n\n    return ans\n```",
