      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef longest_subsequence_sum(nums, target):\n    dp = {}\n    dp[0] = 0\n\n    for num in nums:\n        new_dp = dp.copy()\n        for current_sum, current_length in dp.items():\n            new_sum = current_sum + num\n            new_length = current_length + 1\n            if new_sum <= target:\n                if new_sum not in new_dp or new_length > new_dp[new_sum]:\n                    new_dp[new_sum] = new_length\n        dp = new_dp\n\n    if target in dp:\n        return dp[target]\n    else:\n        return -1\n```",
