    "global index": "MMLUPro_computer science_9214",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Let a undirected graph G with edges E = {{<0,4>,<4,1>,<0,3>,<3,4>,<3,2>,<1,3>}}, which <A,B> represent Node A is connected to Node B. What is the minimum vertex cover of G? Represent the vertex cover in a list of ascending order.\n\nOptions: \nA. [0, 2, 4]\nB. [0, 1, 3, 4]\nC. [3, 4]\nD. [0, 1, 2]\nE. [1, 3]\nF. [1, 2]\nG. [2, 3, 4]\nH. [0, 1]\nI. [2, 4]\nJ. [0, 3, 4]\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
