  {
    "global index": "MMLUPro_computer science_9392",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: This question is based on the following declarations: String strA = \"CARROT\", strB = \"Carrot\", strC = \"car\"; Given that all uppercase letters precede all lowercase letters when considering alphabetical order, which is true?\n\nOptions: \nA. strC.compareTo(strB) > 0 && strB.compareTo(strA) > 0\nB. strA.compareTo(strC) > 0 && strC.compareTo(strB) < 0\nC. strB.compareTo(strC) < 0 && strB.compareTo(strA) > 0\nD. !(strB.compareTo(strA) == 0) && strA.compareTo(strB) > 0\nE. strB.compareTo(strC) > 0 && strA.compareTo(strB) < 0\nF. strC.compareTo(strB) < 0 && strB.compareTo(strA) < 0\nG. strA.compareTo(strB) < 0 && strB.compareTo(strC) > 0\nH. !(strA.compareTo(strB) == 0) && strB.compareTo(strA) < 0\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite",
