 to follow.\n\n*   **H. DIMENSIONX(49), DX(50) DO 50 I = 1, 49 50DX(I) = X(I + 1) - X(I) STOP END**\n    *   X should have 50 elements, not 49.\n\n*   **I. DIMENSION X(51), DX(49) DO 50 I = 1, 49 50 DX(I) = X(I + 1) - X(I) STOP END**\n    *   X should have 50 elements, not 51.\n\n*   **J. DIMENSION X(50), DX(49) DO 50 I = 1, 48 50 DX(I) = X(I + 2) - X(I + 1) STOP END**\n    *   The loop runs up to 48, but should run to 49. The formula is also different from the specified one.\n\nOption E perfectly matches the problem statement's requirements for dimensions, loop range, and the formula for calculating DX(I).\n\nThe final answer is $\\boxed{E}$",
