    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "To calculate the Hamming distances between the codewords (000000, 010101, 101010, 110110), we compare each pair and count the differing bits. The pairwise distances are: \n\n- Distance(000000, 010101) = 3\n- Distance(000000, 101010) = 3\n- Distance(000000, 110110) = 4\n- Distance(010101, 101010) = 4\n- Distance(010101, 110110) = 2\n- Distance(101010, 110110) = 2\n\nThe minimum Hamming distance from these calculations is 2. Thus, the correct answer is \\(\\boxed{D}\\).",
