    "global index": "MMLUPro_computer science_9386",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What is wrong in the following array declaration? int my _ array (200);\n\nOptions: \nA. The datatype for the array elements is not specified\nB. The array is not initialized\nC. The array size is too large\nD. The semicolon is missing at the end of the declaration\nE. The array size should be a constant expression\nF. The array size must be defined after the variable name\nG. The number of subscripts is not enclosed in square brackets\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
