r irrelevancies, we focus on the core issue of comparability.\n\nBased on the general philosophical understanding of the challenges in aggregating pain and Parfit's likely critical stance on such aggregations, the assumption that the pains are comparable is key. Qualitative similarity (C) is a prerequisite for meaningful quantitative comparison and summation.\n\nThe final answer is $\\boxed{C}$.",
