    "global index": "MMLUPro_psychology_2040",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Most people who are suicidal are more dangerous to themselves\n\nOptions: \nA. when they are not on any form of medication\nB. just before beginning antidepressant medication\nC. during the first few days after starting antidepressant medication\nD. as they begin to recover from their depression\nE. during periods of remission from depression\nF. when they first experience symptoms of depression\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
