    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A mother complains thar her 15-year-old daughter “lives like a pig, she is so sloppy and dirty.” She adds, “The more I yell at her, the worse she gets.” In operant conditioning terms, the yelling can best be explained as\n\nOptions: \nA. punishment\nB. negative punishment\nC. negative reinforcement\nD. an unconditioned stimulus\nE. positive reinforcement\nF. a neutral stimulus\nG. a discriminating stimulus for the sloppy behavior\nH. a conditioned stimulus\nI. a conditioned response\nJ. extinction\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
