  {
    "global index": "MMLU_formal_logic_53",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Identify the antecedent of the following conditional proposition: The Bees winning their first game is necessary for either the Aardvarks or the Chipmunks not winning their first game.\n\nOptions: \nA. The Aardvarks do not win their first game.\nB. The Bees win their first game.\nC. The Chipmunks do not win their first game.\nD. Either the Aardvarks or the Chipmunks do not win their first game.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The question asks to identify the antecedent of a conditional proposition. The statement \"A is necessary for B\" can be rephrased as \"If B, then A\" or \"B implies A\". In this case, \"The Bees winning their first game\" (let's call this B) is necessary for \"either the Aardvarks or the Chipmunks not winning their first game\" (let's call this A). Therefore, the proposition is \"If A, then B,\" or \"A implies B.\" The antecedent is the \"if\" part of the conditional, which is A in this structure.\n\nA = \"Either the Aardvarks or the Chipmunks do not win their first game.\"\nB = \"The Bees win their first game.\"\n\nThe statement is \"B is necessary for A,\" which translates to \"If A, then B.\"\nSo, the antecedent is A.\n\nLet's map the options:\nA. The Aardvarks do not win their first game. (Part of A)\nB. The Bees win their first game. (This is B)\nC. The Chipmunks do not win their first game. (Part of A)\nD. Either the Aardvarks or the Chipmunks do not win their first game. (This is A)\n\nSince the antecedent is A, option D is the correct answer.\n\nThe final answer is $\\boxed{D}$.",
      "success": true,
      "token_usage": {
        "input_tokens": 157,
        "output_tokens": 300,
        "total_tokens": 457
      },
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "error": null
    },
    "cost": null,
    "accuracy": null
  },
