ssociated with the senior notes of $ 15 million and $ 19 million as of december 31 , 2017 and 2016 , respectively. .\n\nQuestion: what is the ratio of the deffered tax assets for the state income tax credit carry-forwards to the net operating loss carry-forward\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format, where the content inside the braces is the exact mathematical expression or number. For example: \\boxed{{42}}. Keep your explanation clear, concise, and within 3 sentences.",
