    "global index": "MMLUPro_business_445",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A man shipped his car to Israel. In the United States his car averaged 10 miles to the gallon of gas. He now wishes to convert this figure in order to compare his car's efficiency to that of the Israeli cars. Convert the miles per gallon to kilometers per liter.\n\nOptions: \nA. 7.2 kilometers per liter\nB. 6.5 kilometers per liter\nC. 3.7 kilometers per liter\nD. 2.8 kilometers per liter\nE. 3.0 kilometers per liter\nF. 8.1 kilometers per liter\nG. 4.16 kilometers per liter\nH. 2.2 kilometers per liter\nI. 9.4 kilometers per liter\nJ. 5.3 kilometers per liter\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
