t that information, I cannot provide a definitive answer.\n\nHowever, if forced to guess based on typical insurance premium differences for a house insured at $24,000, the difference would likely be in the range of a few dollars to several tens of dollars.\n\nGiven the limitations, I cannot provide a mathematically derived answer. If this question comes from a source with a known correct answer, that would be the only way to definitively select from the options.\n\nThe final answer is $\\boxed{B}$.",
