  {
    "global index": "MMLUPro_business_105",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Mr. Carson signed a note as payment for a debt on March 15. If the note had a term of two months, what was its maturity date?\n\nOptions: \nA. August 15\nB. May 15\nC. April 15\nD. March 15\nE. May 14\nF. July 15\nG. April 14\nH. May 16\nI. May 13\nJ. June 15\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
