75.\n\nComparing this to the given options:\nA. $5,251\nB. $11,000\nC. $6,251\nD. $10,326\nE. $10,000\nF. $6,326\nG. $5,075\nH. $7,500\nI. $6,000\nJ. $5,000\n\nThe calculated amount of $5,075 matches option G.\n\nThe final answer is $\\boxed{G}$.",
