    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The most likely correct answer is **H**.\n\n\\boxed{H}\nTeam-based selling aims to leverage diverse expertise from different departments within a company to better address the complex needs of a customer. By involving various functional areas, the company can provide a more comprehensive and tailored solution, leading to stronger customer relationships and increased sales. This approach allows for a broader understanding of customer challenges and a more effective problem-solving process.",
