    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion:  Which of the following is not a useful base for segmenting organizational characteristics?\n\nOptions: \nA. By industry type.\nB. By level of technology adoption.\nC. By geographical location.\nD. By turnover.\nE. By organizational culture.\nF. By employee count.\nG. By type of ownership.\nH. By profitability.\nI. By time of establishment.\nJ. By organizational size.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
