    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The fixed effects panel model is also sometimes known as\n\nOptions: \nA. The pooled cross-sectional model\nB. The random effects model\nC. The fixed variable regression model\nD. The instrumental variables regression model\nE. The generalized least squares approach\nF. The least squares dummy variables approach\nG. Heteroscedasticity and autocorrelation consistent\nH. The correlation consistent approach\nI. A seemingly unrelated regression model\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
