    "global index": "MMLUPro_economics_6397",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What is the coefficient of elasticity?\n\nOptions: \nA. The sum of the percentage changes in both the dependent and independent variables\nB. The percentage change in the independent variable divided by the percentage change in the dependent variable\nC. The ratio of the percentage change in the independent variable to the absolute change in the dependent variable\nD. The absolute change in the dependent variable divided by the absolute change in the independent variable\nE. The ratio of the change in the dependent variable to the change in the independent variable\nF. The percentage change in the dependent variable divided by the percentage change in the independent variable\nG. The change in the independent variable divided by the change in the dependent variable\nH. The percentage change in the dependent variable divided by the absolute change in the independent variable\nI. The absolute change in the independent variable divided by the percentage change in the dependent variable\nJ. The sum of the changes in the dependent and independent variables\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
