    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The residual from a standard regression model is defined as\n\nOptions: \nA. The difference between the actual value, y, and the fitted value, y-hat\nB. The square of the difference between the actual value, y, and the fitted value, y-hat\nC. The square of the difference between the fitted value, y-hat, and the mean, y-bar\nD. The difference between the fitted value, y-hat, and the mean, y-bar\nE. The sum of the actual value, y, and the fitted value, y-hat\nF. The difference between the standard deviation, s, and the fitted value, y-hat\nG. The difference between the actual value, y, and the mean, y-bar\nH. The difference between the actual value, y, and the median, m\nI. The square root of the difference between the actual value, y, and the fitted value, y-hat\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
